{"product_id":"monsoon","title":"Monsoon","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"When Brian Brake spent nine months in India photographing the monsoon season of 1960, the images he created became familiar worldwide through their publication in Life, Paris-Match, Queen and Epoca. For the first time this magnificent collection is being reproduced in book form, featuring more than 130 photographs. Accompanying essays commissioned by Brake set out in human terms the effects of the rains on the life and cultural heritage of India\"--Jacket flap.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Brian Brake \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781869536084 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 183\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44967219724441,"sku":"14RA9781869536084","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/ce1003cf00ea178c1641fe9adcd59c2e_85ec3573-8722-4704-a69e-67d3dd2e37d4.jpg?v=1731948153","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/monsoon","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}